{"2523150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Flat", "steam_appid": 2523150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/691d2a377989abc2429c9fd5ab6f979d.poster.avif?t=1780684565\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/691d2a377989abc2429c9fd5ab6f979d.webm?t=1780684565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/691d2a377989abc2429c9fd5ab6f979d.mp4?t=1780684565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMMERSE YOURSELF INTO THE WORLD OF THE FLAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How much can you take, until you snap? The Flat is a first-person action game set within the dark and grotesque walls of Corpo Corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You step into the role of a gray worker, just another cog in the corporate machine. Try to understand the twisted logic that powers this dystopian nightmare and use it to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/30dcdb991d7692c4e16cf494c77833e6.poster.avif?t=1780684565\" width=598 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/30dcdb991d7692c4e16cf494c77833e6.webm?t=1780684565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/30dcdb991d7692c4e16cf494c77833e6.mp4?t=1780684565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you snap? Will you send the boss on a wild goose chase with a fake memo or perhaps 'accidentally' trigger a cascade of events that leads to an office massacre? Your choice, your mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/559d034f6ae6126895d4d5fe57fffbde.poster.avif?t=1780684565\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/559d034f6ae6126895d4d5fe57fffbde.webm?t=1780684565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/559d034f6ae6126895d4d5fe57fffbde.mp4?t=1780684565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Step into a vibrant and dynamic world, bustling with characters living out their daily schedules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Engage in high-octane combat that's as dynamic as you are. Use your surroundings for strategic advantage and turn the tides in your favor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dive into a unique stealth mechanic—your goal isn't to hide, but to pretend to work. How well can you blend in?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Beautifully horrifying brutalist world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/93cc7f9b55e8d8b5933ce4083d26e676.poster.avif?t=1780684565\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/93cc7f9b55e8d8b5933ce4083d26e676.webm?t=1780684565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/93cc7f9b55e8d8b5933ce4083d26e676.mp4?t=1780684565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/691d2a377989abc2429c9fd5ab6f979d.poster.avif?t=1780684565\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/691d2a377989abc2429c9fd5ab6f979d.webm?t=1780684565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/691d2a377989abc2429c9fd5ab6f979d.mp4?t=1780684565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMMERSE YOURSELF INTO THE WORLD OF THE FLAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How much can you take, until you snap? The Flat is a first-person action game set within the dark and grotesque walls of Corpo Corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You step into the role of a gray worker, just another cog in the corporate machine. Try to understand the twisted logic that powers this dystopian nightmare and use it to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/30dcdb991d7692c4e16cf494c77833e6.poster.avif?t=1780684565\" width=598 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/30dcdb991d7692c4e16cf494c77833e6.webm?t=1780684565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/30dcdb991d7692c4e16cf494c77833e6.mp4?t=1780684565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you snap? Will you send the boss on a wild goose chase with a fake memo or perhaps 'accidentally' trigger a cascade of events that leads to an office massacre? Your choice, your mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/559d034f6ae6126895d4d5fe57fffbde.poster.avif?t=1780684565\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/559d034f6ae6126895d4d5fe57fffbde.webm?t=1780684565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/559d034f6ae6126895d4d5fe57fffbde.mp4?t=1780684565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Step into a vibrant and dynamic world, bustling with characters living out their daily schedules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Engage in high-octane combat that's as dynamic as you are. Use your surroundings for strategic advantage and turn the tides in your favor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dive into a unique stealth mechanic—your goal isn't to hide, but to pretend to work. How well can you blend in?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Beautifully horrifying brutalist world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/93cc7f9b55e8d8b5933ce4083d26e676.poster.avif?t=1780684565\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/93cc7f9b55e8d8b5933ce4083d26e676.webm?t=1780684565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/extras/93cc7f9b55e8d8b5933ce4083d26e676.mp4?t=1780684565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "The Flat is an FPS Immersive where you're just a small cog in the vast, dark machinery of Corpo Corporation. Navigate corporate chaos, fight for your life, master unique stealth mechanics, and immerse yourself in a dark brutalist setting. How much can you take before you snap?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Japanese, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Czech<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/47b0ff5139bedcb5f33cb7c97d80c3fd01695521/header.jpg?t=1780684565", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/37c7ba1c7c373dd9960a177ffe7f74c3ed1af86a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780684565", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523150/37c7ba1c7c373dd9960a177ffe7f74c3ed1af86a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780684565", "website": "https://www.threads.net/@the_flat_game", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or AMD Ryzen 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 2080 or newer<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Reco